hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1135","Muhammad bin Sahl bin Askar told us, Abdullah bin Saleh told us, Zakaria bin Yahya bin Aban told us, Abu Saleh told us Muawiyah bin Saleh told me, on the authority of Rabi’ah bin Yazid, on the authority of Abu Idris Al-Khawlani, on the authority of Abu Umamah Al-Bahili, on the authority of the Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace. May God bless him and grant him peace. He said: “You must spend the night in prayer, for it is the custom of the righteous before you, and it brings you closer to your Lord, and it expiates for evil deeds, and to prevent sin.”"
